    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20252" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βοιωτ-άρχης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <u>Boeotarch</u>, one of the
		chief magistrates of the Boeotian league, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			9.15
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Th.
			4.91
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Hell.Oxy.</u>
			11.3
		</span></i>, etc.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βοιώτ-αρχος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			X.
			<u>HG</u>
			3.4.4
		</span></i>: hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βοιωτ-αρχέω</span></b> ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be a Boeotarch</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				59.99
			</span></i>.</div>
